  "details": "Version: 2019.2.1\n\n\nDescription of the bug: Log in freezes. I cannot press cancel, and i can't log in. Uninstalling allows me to reenter, but theres also the issue that i cannot enter any new worlds from my normal home world. Same with default. If i enter a portal, it also hangs. I cannot move, no window pops up, and i just get stuck and im forced to restart. Restarting also brings back the issue of me not being able to log in, so i have to uninstall and reinstall inorder to attempt to come back in. \n\n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): i\nstart my windows mix reality app. i plug in my headset  and then i start vrchat with steam. it loads and then hangs on the log in screen. i cannot press the cancel or any other button.\nRestarting or playing desktop yields same results",
